      "content": "it's not just a \"setback\" though. i've lost the scholarship, i'm failing my classes, and i can see the disappointment in my dad's eyes every time he looks at me. it's like i'm dragging them down with me. if i hadn't been so selfish and wasted their effort, they'd actually be proud of something for once. everything i touch just turns into a mess and makes them suffer more.",
