      "content": "but what if it's not just a lie? what if they're just being nice because they have to be? the truth is that my existence is the thing that's actually wasting their resources. they're pouring everything into a person who just keeps failing. wouldn't it be easier for them if they didn't have to spend their lives trying to fix my mistakes? i feel like the only way to actually honor what they did would be to stop being the burden they're carrying.",
